WEBVTT

1
00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:00.541
After describing the austerities

2
00:01:00.541 --> 00:01:02.000
of body, speech, and mind

3
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.208
in the previous verses of Chapter 17,

4
00:01:05.208 --> 00:01:08.458
now in verses 17.17 to 17.19

5
00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:09.041
Lord Krishna

6
00:01:09.041 --> 00:01:12.583
clearly classifies those austerities
on the basis of the three gunas –

7
00:01:12.583 --> 00:01:14.000
sattva, rajas,

8
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.916
and tamas.

9
00:01:16.916 --> 00:01:20.416
From the outside, these acts may look the same,

10
00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:24.375
but their inner soul – their
purpose, consciousness,

11
00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:28.875
and feeling – decides whether the
austerity is sattvic,

12
00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:31.541
rajasic, or tamasic.

13
00:01:31.541 --> 00:01:32.500
Here Lord Krishna

14
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.083
inspires us to look

15
00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:36.666
within ourselves –

16
00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:40.625
and also to ask: whatever we are doing,

17
00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:42.750
for what purpose are we doing it?

18
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.625
In verse 17.17,

19
00:01:48.625 --> 00:01:51.916
Lord Krishna speaks of the glory
of sattvic austerity.

20
00:01:51.916 --> 00:01:53.083
It occurs when the seeker

21
00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:56.208
is inspired by deep faith.

22
00:01:56.208 --> 00:01:57.875
Such faith is often born

23
00:01:57.875 --> 00:02:00.750
from the company of noble souls.

24
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:01.333
Even if

25
00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:04.791
we are not yet fully spiritual,

26
00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:05.833
faith certainly

27
00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:07.750
awakens within through the company

28
00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:10.208
of saints and sages.

29
00:02:10.208 --> 00:02:11.583
Sattvic austerity

30
00:02:11.583 --> 00:02:13.750
is free from the desire for fruit.

31
00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.250
It is performed with a focused mind.

32
00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:17.125
Its purpose is

33
00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:18.083
only self-

34
00:02:18.083 --> 00:02:21.125
purification and the pleasure of the Paramatma.

35
00:02:21.125 --> 00:02:22.833
Waking up early,

36
00:02:22.833 --> 00:02:25.958
fasting, study of the scriptures,

37
00:02:25.958 --> 00:02:27.250
self-discipline –

38
00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.500
all these acts are sattvic

39
00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:30.958
when their reason is not show,

40
00:02:30.958 --> 00:02:34.291
but self-development.

41
00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:36.625
In verse 17.18, the tone changes.

42
00:02:36.625 --> 00:02:39.291
Here austerity becomes rajasic.

43
00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:41.041
From the outside it looks the same-

44
00:02:41.041 --> 00:02:43.916
but within, the feeling is different.

45
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:46.916
It is done for satkara-mana-pujartham –

46
00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:51.625
that is, to gain honour, recognition, and praise.

47
00:02:51.625 --> 00:02:53.583
Here ego and the desire to look

48
00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:56.625
superior are the very motivators.

49
00:02:56.625 --> 00:02:59.083
The mind keeps an inner account –

50
00:02:59.083 --> 00:03:00.583
‘How many people saw?’

51
00:03:00.583 --> 00:03:03.125
‘Did anyone appreciate it or not?’

52
00:03:03.125 --> 00:03:03.750
Lord Krishna

53
00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:07.083
warns that this austerity is chalam

54
00:03:07.083 --> 00:03:11.708
adhruvam – that is, unstable, momentary.

55
00:03:11.708 --> 00:03:14.750
Even when honour is received, it does not last.

56
00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.958
The satisfaction remains superficial.
And if praise is not received,

57
00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:22.833
then frustration and irritation grow within.

58
00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:26.083
Instead of becoming pure,
the person gets entangled

59
00:03:26.083 --> 00:03:29.250
even more deeply in ego.

60
00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.750
In verse 17.19, Lord Krishna

61
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:33.583
describes its most harmful form –

62
00:03:33.583 --> 00:03:35.583
tamasic austerity.

63
00:03:35.583 --> 00:03:38.083
It is done with mudha-graheṇa –

64
00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:41.083
that is, with foolish stubbornness.

65
00:03:41.083 --> 00:03:43.625
In it the seeker gives suffering to themselves,

66
00:03:43.625 --> 00:03:46.125
or causes injury to others.

67
00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:47.166
The austerities of Hiranyakashipu

68
00:03:47.166 --> 00:03:50.333
and Ravana are examples of this.

69
00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:52.750
Their aim was not spiritual progress,

70
00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.333
but power and destruction.

71
00:03:55.333 --> 00:03:57.875
Even today, people torment the body,

72
00:03:57.875 --> 00:04:00.375
keep fasts that damage health,

73
00:04:00.375 --> 00:04:02.666
and think that this itself is dharma.

74
00:04:02.666 --> 00:04:04.500
Some wish to gather power

75
00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.583
and dominate others.

76
00:04:06.583 --> 00:04:09.625
This austerity is destructive, delusional,

77
00:04:09.625 --> 00:04:13.458
and cut off from spiritual reality.

78
00:04:13.458 --> 00:04:15.208
The message is clear –

79
00:04:15.208 --> 00:04:18.500
austerity is not spiritual in itself.

80
00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.625
Its value depends on the purpose.

81
00:04:21.625 --> 00:04:24.125
Austerity done with faith and humility

82
00:04:24.125 --> 00:04:26.166
lifts the seeker higher.

83
00:04:26.166 --> 00:04:29.666
And austerity done with ego or malice

84
00:04:29.666 --> 00:04:34.083
leads only toward bondage and downfall.

85
00:04:38.916 --> 00:04:42.291
You may adopt many disciplines –

86
00:04:42.291 --> 00:04:46.125
waking up early, fasting,

87
00:04:46.125 --> 00:04:49.791
studying, or meditating.

88
00:04:49.791 --> 00:04:54.166
But ask yourself this question –

89
00:04:54.166 --> 00:04:56.750
why am I doing this?

90
00:04:56.750 --> 00:05:00.458
If the purpose is only to look spiritual,

91
00:05:00.458 --> 00:05:06.250
or to feel superior to others,

92
00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:09.916
then this effort becomes rajasic.

93
00:05:09.916 --> 00:05:13.708
It feeds the ego, not the soul.

94
00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:17.416
But if it is done with peace,

95
00:05:17.416 --> 00:05:24.291
with deep faith, and with the
longing for spiritual growth,

96
00:05:24.291 --> 00:05:28.375
then it becomes sattvic.

97
00:05:28.375 --> 00:05:31.208
It purifies the heart.

98
00:05:31.208 --> 00:05:33.250
True austerity

99
00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.875
does not need an audience.

100
00:05:36.875 --> 00:05:40.083
It becomes radiant

101
00:05:40.083 --> 00:05:43.458
when done in silence –

102
00:05:43.458 --> 00:05:47.500
without applause and without display.

103
00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:51.250
You may bear difficulties in your life

104
00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:54.250
with patience,

105
00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.333
or even make

106
00:05:55.333 --> 00:05:57.916
sacrifices for your loved ones.

107
00:05:57.916 --> 00:06:02.625
But if within you keep an account of them,

108
00:06:02.625 --> 00:06:06.958
or wait for praise, then

109
00:06:06.958 --> 00:06:08.833
peace will not be found.

110
00:06:08.833 --> 00:06:10.250
I do not see only

111
00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.875
what you are doing –

112
00:06:12.875 --> 00:06:15.625
I also see

113
00:06:15.625 --> 00:06:18.458
why you are doing it.

114
00:06:18.458 --> 00:06:20.583
Discipline should be joined not with pride,

115
00:06:20.583 --> 00:06:23.750
but with sincerity.

116
00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.333
When no one is watching,

117
00:06:26.333 --> 00:06:31.250
and even then you walk the path of truth –

118
00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:34.750
only then does the soul become luminous.

119
00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.125
Quiet effort,

120
00:06:36.125 --> 00:06:39.750
when done with pure feeling –

121
00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:43.583
this itself becomes the path of true progress.

122
00:06:48.458 --> 00:06:50.750
Understand this –

123
00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:54.416
in your family, fasts, rituals,

124
00:06:54.416 --> 00:06:55.666
and festivals

125
00:06:55.666 --> 00:06:58.458
should be expressions of love –

126
00:06:58.458 --> 00:07:01.500
not a display to attract attention.

127
00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:05.833
If you light a lamp or keep a fast

128
00:07:05.833 --> 00:07:08.583
only to impress guests

129
00:07:08.583 --> 00:07:10.791
or for show,

130
00:07:10.791 --> 00:07:12.416
then your actions

131
00:07:12.416 --> 00:07:15.250
may look spiritual from outside, but

132
00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:18.916
they remain rajasic –

133
00:07:18.916 --> 00:07:22.416
bound by ego and praise.

134
00:07:22.416 --> 00:07:26.125
I want your children

135
00:07:26.125 --> 00:07:29.708
to learn devotion from your quiet faith,

136
00:07:29.708 --> 00:07:33.208
not from your desire for praise.

137
00:07:33.208 --> 00:07:36.083
Teach them that true actions

138
00:07:36.083 --> 00:07:40.125
should be done even when no one is watching.

139
00:07:40.125 --> 00:07:41.250
When you

140
00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:44.791
rise early for prayer,

141
00:07:44.791 --> 00:07:47.500
clean the home with reverence,

142
00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.833
or serve the elders with love –

143
00:07:50.833 --> 00:07:52.583
and do not expect

144
00:07:52.583 --> 00:07:55.583
thanks in return –

145
00:07:55.583 --> 00:07:58.375
then you show them the true form

146
00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:00.250
of spiritual practice.

147
00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:04.083
Do not measure your faith by how

148
00:08:04.083 --> 00:08:07.083
many people saw you,

149
00:08:07.083 --> 00:08:09.833
but by this –

150
00:08:09.833 --> 00:08:15.416
how much peace and regularity
you carry it out with.

151
00:08:15.416 --> 00:08:19.083
Purity dwells in simplicity.

152
00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:22.791
And when your heart is pure,

153
00:08:22.791 --> 00:08:27.125
then even the smallest act done at home

154
00:08:27.125 --> 00:08:30.083
becomes an offering to Me.

155
00:08:30.083 --> 00:08:34.083
Do it with love, not for praise –

156
00:08:34.083 --> 00:08:37.666
and your family will be filled with grace.

157
00:08:42.583 --> 00:08:45.375
You work long hours,

158
00:08:45.375 --> 00:08:47.208
take on extra tasks,

159
00:08:47.208 --> 00:08:50.958
and push forward even under pressure –

160
00:08:50.958 --> 00:08:55.583
but ask yourself this question:

161
00:08:55.583 --> 00:08:59.083
for whom am I doing all this?

162
00:08:59.083 --> 00:09:00.833
Understand this –

163
00:09:00.833 --> 00:09:03.833
if the effort is only to gain praise,

164
00:09:03.833 --> 00:09:07.916
recognition, or attention,

165
00:09:07.916 --> 00:09:11.291
then it becomes rajasic.

166
00:09:11.291 --> 00:09:15.083
Yes, people may notice you,

167
00:09:15.083 --> 00:09:19.916
and you may even receive an award,
but that satisfaction

168
00:09:19.916 --> 00:09:22.208
is not lasting.

169
00:09:22.208 --> 00:09:25.625
It rises for a moment like a wave,

170
00:09:25.625 --> 00:09:30.333
and scatters immediately too.

171
00:09:30.333 --> 00:09:32.375
True progress

172
00:09:32.375 --> 00:09:36.083
does not come from drawing attention.

173
00:09:36.083 --> 00:09:37.583
It comes from

174
00:09:37.583 --> 00:09:39.833
quiet, steady,

175
00:09:39.833 --> 00:09:43.708
and purposeful effort.

176
00:09:43.708 --> 00:09:48.083
Be like a tree, which keeps giving
fruit continuously,

177
00:09:48.083 --> 00:09:52.583
even to the one who throws stones at it.

178
00:09:52.583 --> 00:09:53.625
As long as

179
00:09:53.625 --> 00:09:57.333
it receives nourishment and water from nature,

180
00:09:57.333 --> 00:10:00.250
it selflessly provides flowers,

181
00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.625
fruit, shade, and wood –

182
00:10:03.625 --> 00:10:06.833
without expecting any praise.

183
00:10:06.833 --> 00:10:11.208
When you work with a sincere feeling –

184
00:10:11.208 --> 00:10:13.833
not to impress others,

185
00:10:13.833 --> 00:10:16.875
but to serve,

186
00:10:16.875 --> 00:10:20.500
to learn, and to contribute –

187
00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:23.958
then your work becomes sattvic.

188
00:10:23.958 --> 00:10:29.083
And sattvic work gives stability,
gives strength,

189
00:10:29.083 --> 00:10:33.083
and leaves behind a lasting legacy.

190
00:10:33.083 --> 00:10:35.583
I do not see only

191
00:10:35.583 --> 00:10:38.583
how many hours you gave,

192
00:10:38.583 --> 00:10:41.166
I also see

193
00:10:41.166 --> 00:10:45.833
with what feeling you gave that time.

194
00:10:45.833 --> 00:10:51.416
So do your work with sincerity.

195
00:10:51.416 --> 00:10:56.458
Because that very work, which is
done with humility,

196
00:10:56.458 --> 00:11:00.125
is the one that truly lasts.

197
00:11:00.125 --> 00:11:01.458
Reflect on this.
